{"id":"77c7610a882dcfdc","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_TAConseq.md","title":"TAConseq","display":"TAConseq","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"TAConseq","parameters":["g","a"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"TAConseq"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>g</span><span>a</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：对象理论模型与证明。有序参数：<code>g</code>、<code>a</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ TAConseq g a)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists E\n  (exists F\n    (exists R\n      (exists f\n        (exists r\n          (exists T\n            (exists U\n              (and (@ ArSig E F R f r) (and (@ TheoryTA T) (and (@ Union2 T g U) (@ FConseq E F R f r U a)))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"35d6d56fbb2c8833\" href=\"?note=35d6d56fbb2c8833\" title=\"ZFC_ArSig\">ArSig</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4ab9e67d837fd090\" href=\"?note=4ab9e67d837fd090\" title=\"ZFC_FConseq\">FConseq</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d8fade1b824f7bfb\" href=\"?note=d8fade1b824f7bfb\" title=\"ZFC_TheoryTA\">TheoryTA</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"bb2bfe91c0c7d416\" href=\"?note=bb2bfe91c0c7d416\" title=\"ZFC_Union2\">Union2</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ TAConseq g a)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_ArSig","status":"resolved","id":"35d6d56fbb2c8833","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_ArSig|ArSig]]；[[ZFC_FConseq|FConseq]]；[[ZFC_TheoryTA|TheoryTA]]；[[ZFC_Union2|Union2]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FConseq","status":"resolved","id":"4ab9e67d837fd090","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_ArSig|ArSig]]；[[ZFC_FConseq|FConseq]]；[[ZFC_TheoryTA|TheoryTA]]；[[ZFC_Union2|Union2]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_TheoryTA","status":"resolved","id":"d8fade1b824f7bfb","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_ArSig|ArSig]]；[[ZFC_FConseq|FConseq]]；[[ZFC_TheoryTA|TheoryTA]]；[[ZFC_Union2|Union2]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Union2","status":"resolved","id":"bb2bfe91c0c7d416","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_ArSig|ArSig]]；[[ZFC_FConseq|FConseq]]；[[ZFC_TheoryTA|TheoryTA]]；[[ZFC_Union2|Union2]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务","status":"resolved","id":"593f9bdab4d60707","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"证明状态","excerpt":"本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 [[000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务]]。","embed":false}],"math":[],"bytes":1007,"backlinks":[{"id":"123c0b237d7b0c5a","anchor":"ref-676","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[规范公式/ZFC_TAConseq|TAConseq]]"},{"id":"41ff25a0d22aeaaf","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_TAConseq|TACons